{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜西藏那曲市7級地震／伊朗軍方稱已做好應對非對稱戰爭準備\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-CN-QUAKE-261023A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】10月23日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【七級地震】西藏那曲市發生7級地震，已造成16人死亡。</p><p>【作戰準備】伊朗軍方指德黑蘭無人機技術成熟，已做好應對非對稱戰爭的準備。</p><p>【科技股拖累】美國股市受科技股拖累，納指收市跌逾百分之2，道指低開再急挫之後回穩。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:59:40.270959+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:07:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:32.255694+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:58:04.934285+00:00","content_hash":"d8488ac2e18e12c1b19b662103c9a215b8b2ed81fcd4b28f86f4e7c2a87a909e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}